🤖 CodeAlpha Basic Chatbot

A simple rule-based chatbot developed in Python as part of the CodeAlpha Python Programming Internship.

The chatbot accepts user messages and provides predefined responses using Python functions and conditional statements.

📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how basic Python programming concepts can be used to create an interactive chatbot.

The chatbot recognizes predefined messages such as:

hello
how are you
bye

For unknown messages, the chatbot provides a default response.

✨ Features
👋 Greeting response
💬 Conversation interaction
🤖 Rule-based responses
❓ Handles unknown messages
🔄 Continuous conversation
🚪 bye command to exit
🧩 Function-based design
💻 Console interface
